.SS "int wget_vector_replace (wget_vector * v, const void * elem, int pos)"

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIv\fP Vector where \fRelem\fP is inserted 
.br
\fIelem\fP Element to insert into \fRv\fP 
.br
\fIpos\fP Position to insert \fRelem\fP at 
