\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIv\fP Vector to be free'd
.RE
.PP
Free the vector \fRv\fP and it's contents\&.

.PP
For each element the destructor function is called and the element free'd thereafter\&. Then the vector itself is free'd and set to NULL\&. 
.SS "void wget_vector_clear (wget_vector * v)"

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIv\fP Vector to be cleared
.RE
.PP
Free all elements of the vector \fRv\fP but not the vector itself\&.

.PP
For each element the destructor function is called and the element free'd thereafter\&. The vector is then empty and can be reused\&. 
.SS "void wget_vector_clear_nofree (wget_vector * v)"

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIv\fP Vector to be cleared
.RE
.PP
Remove all elements of the vector \fRv\fP without free'ing them\&. The caller is responsible to care for the elements\&.

.PP
The vector is then empty and can be reused\&. 
